# Djot content files (docs site). GitHub has no Djot renderer, so tell Linguist to
# syntax-highlight `.dj` as Markdown in the file/diff view — headings, code fences,
# lists and emphasis get colorized, which is what makes content PRs readable on GitHub.
# (This highlights the source; the rendered reading surface is `pnpm run docs:serve`.)
*.dj linguist-language=Markdown
*.dj text
